# Files the serving image gets: the packages the API imports (all of them are
# installed with the project) and config.yaml for the store. Steps, tests,
# pipeline entry points, data and models stay out.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!LICENSE
!config.yaml
!src/core
!src/libs
!src/utils
!src/serving
**/__pycache__
